    "limitations": "One-repository local_template only. Recognition rules and annotation-state representation evolve across these revisions and must be preserved separately. The cast repair shown is limited to a string first positional argument; arbitrary call arguments are not covered. Shared issue 447 support also appears in the annotation-partition group and counts only once globally. No execution or transfer claim is made.",
